  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1213.11 Validation Procedure for An Alternative Add-On Control System",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1213.11 Validation Procedure for An Alternative Add-On Control System. A source selecting an alternative compliance technique pursuant to Env-A 1213.10(a) shall demonstrate, in accordance with the procedures of Env-A 804.09, that the overall percentage reduction achieved by the add-on control system equals or exceeds the percentage reduction required to meet the applicable VOC content limit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1200.html"
